"In his first week Nathan's Stamina fell from 250 to 150 in a tower sprint, then to 36 after escape."
"Later Nathan's Stamina was Deepened Stamina (14696/15810), then Bottomless Stamina."
"His Bottomless Stamina maximum rose exactly 100 per End of Magic level, reaching 134700."
"Nathan spends Stamina to stand on air, push sideways in freefall and heal wounds through his Talent."
"Nathan regained Stamina by absorbing spells and mana; destroyed power turns into Stamina for him."
"Once, absorbing huge magic filled his Stamina past its maximum; the excess steamed off his skin."
"A mage could top up Nathan's Stamina by feeding him magic."
"Nathan regrew a severed hand in seconds by pushing Stamina into it."
"Kamus's hand spell drained a third of Stamina and Focus per touch."
"After his last war Nathan's Stamina sat at 1831/129100, full again within a day of rest."
